    {
      "id": "bYxYKI22g5YAzV4n6TAB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 1909.375,
      "width": 999.5999999999999,
      "height": 191.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1010947869,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 657731186,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792716627901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key design decisions\n• Two-stage pipeline: Spot workers only EXECUTE; grading happens on the permanent plane\n  (Evaluation Queue → Minion Orchestrator). If the LLM fails, only the evaluation is retried.\n• Grade confidence ≥ 0.85 is published automatically; < 0.85 or a 2 % random sample\n  goes to Manual Review by the Teaching Assistant.\n• Punctuality is decided by the submission timestamp + receipt, never by grading time.\n• Sharding by course_id (queues, workers, DBs); courses with > 300 students get a dedicated shard.\n• AI in 2 phases: CPU smoke test per attempt, GPU only for the final submission.\n• Grading SLO: 100 % of submissions graded within 24 h (48 h is the professor's hard limit).",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "qKyJExLR00xcJSoR8Nap",
      "originalText": "Key design decisions\n• Two-stage pipeline: Spot workers only EXECUTE; grading happens on the permanent plane\n  (Evaluation Queue → Minion Orchestrator). If the LLM fails, only the evaluation is retried.\n• Grade confidence ≥ 0.85 is published automatically; < 0.85 or a 2 % random sample\n  goes to Manual Review by the Teaching Assistant.\n• Punctuality is decided by the submission timestamp + receipt, never by grading time.\n• Sharding by course_id (queues, workers, DBs); courses with > 300 students get a dedicated shard.\n• AI in 2 phases: CPU smoke test per attempt, GPU only for the final submission.\n• Grading SLO: 100 % of submissions graded within 24 h (48 h is the professor's hard limit).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b4A"
    },
    {
      "id": "Bf2BM4uc0t00vWzb2am1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 1840,
      "width": 1060,
      "height": 330,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1016545535,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 943827374,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "0WJAANnWnRvNk1lgBOio"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1792716627901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b4B"
    },
    {
      "id": "0WJAANnWnRvNk1lgBOio",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1128,
      "y": 1898.75,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 212.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1072699815,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 625578034,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792716627901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reliability\n• Spot 2-min notice: Interruption Handler drains the node; AI jobs resume from the Checkpoint Store.\n• A graceful Spot interruption does not count as a failure; only real infra failures\n  count, max 3 retries → Dead Letter Queue + alert.\n• Student OOM / timeout is a grade, never retried.\n• Submissions DB: Multi-AZ standby with synchronous replication and automatic failover\n  (SPOF mitigated); sharding by course_id limits the blast radius.\n• Spot capacity Circuit Breaker: an instance type/AZ without capacity is skipped for 15 min.\n• LLM calls: Prompt Injection Guard → Rate Limiter → Circuit Breaker; Response Cache;\n  output validated against a JSON Schema.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Bf2BM4uc0t00vWzb2am1",
      "originalText": "Reliability\n• Spot 2-min notice: Interruption Handler drains the node; AI jobs resume from the Checkpoint Store.\n• A graceful Spot interruption does not count as a failure; only real infra failures\n  count, max 3 retries → Dead Letter Queue + alert.\n• Student OOM / timeout is a grade, never retried.\n• Submissions DB: Multi-AZ standby with synchronous replication and automatic failover\n  (SPOF mitigated); sharding by course_id limits the blast radius.\n• Spot capacity Circuit Breaker: an instance type/AZ without capacity is skipped for 15 min.\n• LLM calls: Prompt Injection Guard → Rate Limiter → Circuit Breaker; Response Cache;\n  output validated against a JSON Schema.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b4C"
    },
