      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792716627901,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Migration and scaling\n• Strangler Router sends each course to the Legacy Grader or to the new shards; Data Migration\n  backfills history and keeps a dual-run sync until 2 assessments match 100 %.\n• Pre-scaler warms up workers and pre-loads base images (3–5 GB) before every deadline.\n• Status reads: Status Cache (cache-aside, invalidated by events) → Results DB Read Replica.\n• Peak per deadline (assumption): 3,000 Programming, 600 Architecture, 400 AI submissions.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Uz1f1JBN07ZoKBRuG2cp",
      "originalText": "Migration and scaling\n• Strangler Router sends each course to the Legacy Grader or to the new shards; Data Migration\n  backfills history and keeps a dual-run sync until 2 assessments match 100 %.\n• Pre-scaler warms up workers and pre-loads base images (3–5 GB) before every deadline.\n• Status reads: Status Cache (cache-aside, invalidated by events) → Results DB Read Replica.\n• Peak per deadline (assumption): 3,000 Programming, 600 Architecture, 400 AI submissions.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b4E"
    },
